# Builds the native end of the encrypted reliable UDP interoperability check.
#
# Run `node ci/rudp-interop/run.js` once this, ci/rudp-interop-jvm.hxml and
# ci/rudp-interop-node.hxml are built: each end's sealed datagrams are opened by
# the others': libsodium, the jvm's Haxe ChaCha20-Poly1305, Node's crypto.
-cp src
-cp tests/rudp-interop
-D windows
-D HXCPP_M64
-main RudpInteropPeer
--cpp export/rudp-interop
